[{"commit":{"message":"MeshView: Use weak_ptr for Mesh and Material references\n\nChanged in-line with NativePhongMaterial change in previous commit"},"files":[{"filename":"modules\/javafx.graphics\/src\/main\/native-prism-d3d12\/D3D12NativeDevice.cpp"},{"filename":"modules\/javafx.graphics\/src\/main\/native-prism-d3d12\/D3D12NativeMeshView.cpp"},{"filename":"modules\/javafx.graphics\/src\/main\/native-prism-d3d12\/D3D12NativeMeshView.hpp"},{"filename":"modules\/javafx.graphics\/src\/main\/native-prism-d3d12\/render-thread\/D3D12RenderThreadExecutable.hpp"}],"sha":"44a660c90b70ae2f1d04da0bb5809bde38ce7738"},{"commit":{"message":"Review fixes from general comments from @kevinrushforth\n\n- D3D12Context.java correctly handles NULL destination RTT now\n- D3D12SwapChain.java prevents potential NPE when disposing\n- D3D12RenderingContext.cpp:\n  - Shader assignments are now checked based on stored Shader parameter\n    instead of PSO's bound Shader (fixes incorrect shader resource\n    assignments after restoring the Context after Blit)\n  - Clear now handles dirty bboxes better (fixes unnecessary and\/or\n    incorrect bbox estimation)\n- D3D12Graphics.java now provides premultiplied clear parameters\n- D3D12NativeSwapChain.cpp now checks for tearing support when VSync is\n  requested disabled, will fall-back to enabled VSync if device does not\n  support it or we cannot poll DXGI for support\n- D3D12NativeRenderTarget.cpp sets underlying Texture's sampling to\n  linear to match D3D's settings\n- D3D12NativePhongMaterial.cpp now uses weak pointers to refer to\n  texture maps - prevents keeping strong references and keeping the\n  resources alive despite NativeTexture being released\n\nAdditionally:\n- Added logic to unbind Textures from RenderingContext when they are\n  disposed\n- Added a missing Clear call to createRTTexture (found it in D3D backend)\n- RenderPerfTest will respect java.animation.fullspeed pre-set when\n  it is set via a JVM argument"},"files":[{"file